  "caption": "He had the cleanest cafe on the street.\n\nThe tables were set, the lights were on, the door was open. He even went outside to see what was wrong. People still walked past it all day.\n\nThe problem was never the cafe. It was that nobody searching the neighbourhood could find it. Every other place showed up. His didn't.\n\nThat part is fixable, and it is usually the cheapest thing on the list.\n\nWhat would someone type to find a business like yours?"
